":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8L8r?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=gt%E4%BA%9A%E9%A9%AC%E9%80%8A%E7%94%B5%E5%95%86%E5%9F%B9%E8%AE%AD%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%9B%BE,%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86ip%F0%9F%94%B4lu911.com%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F,%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E5%AE%A3%E4%BC%A0%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF,%E5%A5%BD%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84vpn%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA,%E5%A4%96%E8%B4%B8%E7%9A%84%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95,%E2%9C%85%E2%9C%85%E7%BA%AF%E5%87%80%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86ip%F0%9F%94%B4lu911.com%E2%9C%85%E2%9C%85,vps%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%BF%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90,%E6%B5%B7%E5%A4%96vpn%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"爆款素材到底怎么复刻？明白了吗？#电商运营 #电商干货 #千川投放技巧 #千川运营 #千川素材","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7675271218589880187","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7675271218589880187","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"获取千川素材库图文-素材管理-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1778159308092424","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1778159308092424","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"文章详情 - 巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/help/content/root?__forever__userAdvid=1696543798927432&graphId=397&mappingType=1&spaceId=122&visitor_source=support_sdk","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/help/content/root?__forever__userAdvid=1696543798927432&graphId=397&mappingType=1&spaceId=122&visitor_source=support_sdk","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"文章详情 - 巨量千川规则中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/support/content/root?graphId=395&mappingType=1&pageId=221&spaceId=122","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/support/content/root?graphId=395&mappingType=1&pageId=221&spaceId=122","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"smp-c68992ca357a4bd6ac945c0bfe6c08cf","q":"CMCR-Q0034","question":"千川素材去重和素材复刻有什么区别？","day":1,"repeat":3,"valid":true,"answer":"# 千川素材：素材去重 VS 素材复刻\n> 一句话总结：**素材复刻是「借鉴爆款框架来建新素材」；素材去重是「修改素材，降低和已有素材的相似度，避免同质化挤压/搬运判定」**\n\n## ✅ 素材复刻（爆款框架复用）\n核心目标：**继承已经验证跑量的创意逻辑，批量产出新素材**\n- 做的是：保留爆款的钩子结构、口播逻辑、分镜节奏、卖点顺序；**更换画面、人物、产品、场景**，不是原样照搬画面\n- 出发点：基于爆款基因裂变，提高新素材起量概率，属于素材生产思路（巨量即创里的爆款素材裂变就是这类思路）\n- 风险点：如果只是轻微微调画面，会被系统判定**同质化素材**，进入排队投放、互相挤压流量，起量受限\n- 关键词：**学结构，换内容**；生产新素材\n\n## ✅ 素材去重（降低素材相似度）\n核心目标：**规避平台画面指纹、相似度识别，防止被判搬运/同质化**\n- 做的是：对现有视频做修改，改变画面帧、音频、剪辑顺序、色调、画幅、片段重组，修改素材指纹，降低和原片的相似度\n- 出发点：**修改素材本身**，让系统识别为不同素材，解决同质化标签、审核搬运风险\n- 风险点：浅层去重（只改BGM、调色、简单裁切）很容易被平台识别，依旧打上同质化标签；单纯改MD5无效，千川是画面帧相似度检测，不是只看文件哈希\n- 关键词：**改画面，降相似度**；对已有素材二次修改\n\n# 对比表\n|项目|素材复刻|素材去重|\n| ---- | ---- | ---- |\n|本质|素材生产，借鉴爆款脚本框架|素材修改，降低素材相似度|\n|目的|复用跑量逻辑，提高新素材成功率|规避同质化挤压、搬运判定|\n|操作重点|保留钩子/分镜节奏，替换产品、人物、场景|改动画面、剪辑、音频、镜头顺序|\n|平台视角|做得好=全新差异化素材；做得差=同质化素材|浅层修改基本无效，深度修改才会降低相似度|\n|适用场景|爆款素材裂变，批量新建素材|老素材二创、搬运素材修改|\n\n## 重要提醒（千川官方同质化规则）\n平台判断同质化，看**画面内容相似度**，不是文件MD5；仅替换BGM、调色、增减少量片段属于轻度改动，依然会被判定同质化，造成账户素材排队投放，消耗困难。\n> 合规的素材复刻，需要做到**大部分画面、实拍主体、场景重新制作**，不是简单套模板微改。\n\n如果你需要，我可以给你一份千川素材避免同质化的实操标准，区分“安全二创”和“浅层去重”。\n","answerHash":"2e2bff9fcaa4cc96f0e8000314616f85f535b31479bf570cf6e9c837f513f0ed","finishedAt":"2026-10-12","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"巨量创意","url":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/media-policy?type=3","normalizedUrl":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/media-policy?type=3","domain":"cc.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8L8r?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8L8r?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量千川视频发布频次& 新建素材数限制说明","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHYCbjGEshyy","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHYCbjGEshyy","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"获取视频素材评估标签(新版)-素材管理-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1789500809829388?origin=left_nav","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1789500809829388?origin=left_nav","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量千川简介 - 产品介绍 - 巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11747/213216","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11747/213216","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"先一刀，再混剪，最后AI重绘治根 #AI电商 #千川素材 #千川运营 #电商日常","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7678627953097411867","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7678627953097411867","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量创意","url":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/media-policy?type=3","normalizedUrl":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/media-policy?type=3","domain":"cc.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8L8r?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8L8r?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量创意","url":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/article-detail/7720c6799f72ed4b0dda64a4723fe92d","normalizedUrl":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/article-d